001308179-26-000439":{"c":"CSCO","form":"DEF 14A","filed":"2026-10-29"}},"finsights":{"CSCO":[{"topic":"fcf","text":"Free cash flow was $12.8 billion in FY2026: operating cash flow of $14.2 billion less capital spending of $1.4 billion (computed from two filed figures). That is 20.2% of revenue. In FY2021 it was $14.8 billion.","cites":["CSCO.ocf.2026","CSCO.capex.2026","CSCO.revenue.2026","CSCO.ocf.2021","CSCO.capex.2021"]},{"topic":"sbc","text":"Stock-based compensation was $3.8 billion in FY2026, 6% of revenue, against 3.5% in FY2021.","cites":["CSCO.sbc.2026","CSCO.revenue.2026","CSCO.sbc.2021","CSCO.revenue.2021"]},{"topic":"returns","text":"In FY2026 the company paid $6.1 billion to repurchase its own shares and $6.6 billion in dividends: $12.7 billion together (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["CSCO.buybacks.2026","CSCO.dividends.2026"]},{"topic":"quarter","text":"In the three months ended 2026-10-24 revenue was $18.5 billion, up 24.4% from $14.9 billion in the three months ended 2025-10-25.","cites":["CSCO.d.revenue.2026-07-26.2026-10-24","CSCO.d.revenue.2025-07-27.2025-10-25"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-10-24 revenue added up to $67 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $17.6 billion and net income to $15 billion.","cites":["CSCO.d.revenue.2025-10-26.2026-01-24","CSCO.d.revenue.2026-01-25.2026-04-25","CSCO.d.revenue.2025-07-27.2026-07-25","CSCO.d.revenue.2025-07-27.2026-04-25","CSCO.d.revenue.2026-07-26.2026-10-24","CSCO.d.opinc.2025-10-26.2026-01-24","CSCO.d.opinc.2026-01-25.2026-04-25","CSCO.d.opinc.2025-07-27.2026-07-25","CSCO.d.opinc.2025-07-27.2026-04-25","CSCO.d.opinc.2026-07-26.2026-10-24","CSCO.d.netinc.2025-10-26.2026-01-24","CSCO.d.netinc.2026-01-25.2026-04-25","CSCO.d.netinc.2025-07-27.2026-07-25","CSCO.d.netinc.2025-07-27.2026-04-25","CSCO.d.netinc.2026-07-26.2026-10-24"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $13.7 billion: operating cash flow of $15.3 billion less capital spending of $1.6 billion (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["CSCO.d.ocf.2025-07-27.2026-01-24","CSCO.d.ocf.2025-07-27.2025-10-25","CSCO.d.ocf.2025-07-27.2026-04-25","CSCO.d.ocf.2025-07-27.2026-07-25","CSCO.d.ocf.2026-07-26.2026-10-24","CSCO.d.capex.2025-07-27.2026-01-24","CSCO.d.capex.2025-07-27.2025-10-25","CSCO.d.capex.2025-07-27.2026-04-25","CSCO.d.capex.2025-07-27.2026-07-25","CSCO.d.capex.2026-07-26.2026-10-24"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The proxy statement filed 2026-10-29 gives the principal executive officer’s total pay for FY2026 as $48.5 million in its summary compensation table, and the “compensation actually paid” - the SEC’s measure, which revalues share awards over the year - as $132 million.","cites":["CSCO.pay.peoTotal.2026","CSCO.pay.peoPaid.2026"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"For the other named executive officers the same table gives an average of $15.7 million in total and $42.5 million actually paid.","cites":["CSCO.pay.neoTotal.2026","CSCO.pay.neoPaid.2026"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The table puts the value of $100 held in the company’s shares over the years it covers at $237.22 at the end of FY2026, and $253.20 for the peer group the company chose.","cites":["CSCO.pay.tsr.2026","CSCO.pay.peerTsr.2026"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Remaining performance obligations - revenue under contract that was not yet recognised - were $46.7 billion at the end of FY2026, against $43.5 billion a year earlier. That is 73.8% of FY2026 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["CSCO.rpo.2026","CSCO.rpo.2025","CSCO.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $29.8 billion at the end of FY2026 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiability), against $28.8 billion a year earlier.","cites":["CSCO.deferred.2026","CSCO.deferred.2025"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 82,400 in its own words. FY2026 revenue works out to about $769,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["CSCO.q.employees","CSCO.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"flags","text":"The FY2026 annual report tags restructuring charges of $693 million, after $744 million in FY2025.","cites":["CSCO.restructuring.2026","CSCO.restructuring.2025"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2026 the balance sheet carried $7.2 billion in cash and cash equivalents and $8.7 billion in short-term investments, and $29.5 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtNoncurrent + DebtCurrent). Debt less cash and short-term investments was $13.6 billion (computed from four filed figures).","cites":["CSCO.cash.2026","CSCO.sti.2026","CSCO.debtLong.2026","CSCO.debtCurrent.2026"]}]},"fin":{"CSCO":{"insiders":{"from":"2025-11-23","to":"2026-11-23","complete":true,"listed":106,"read":106,"other":0,"failed":0,"odd":0,"people":[["Subaiya Thimaya K.","EVP, Operations"],["Robbins Charles","Chair and CEO, director"],["Fink Nichlas A","SVP, Chief Accounting Officer"],["Patel Jeetendra I","President and CPO"],["Patterson Mark","EVP and CFO"],["Stahlkopf Deborah L","EVP and Chief Legal Officer"],["Tuszik Oliver","EVP, Global Sales"],["Wong Maria Victoria","SVP & Chief Acctg Officer"],["CAPELLAS MICHAEL D","Director"],["JOHNSON KRISTINA M","Director"]],"rows":[["S",0,21186,2041828.42,"2026-11-19","2026-11-19","0000858877-26-000200","2026-11-20",1],["S",1,286985,27322986.06,"2026-11-16","2026-11-18","0000858877-26-000197","2026-11-18",1],["S",2,3287,311153.24,"2026-11-16","2026-11-16","0000858877-26-000191","2026-11-17",1],["S",3,64468,6101147.97,"2026-11-16","2026-11-16","0000858877-26-000192","2026-11-17",1],["S",4,30762,2911445.4,"2026-11-16","2026-11-16","0000858877-26-000193","2026-11-17",1],["S",5,83345,7887606.7,"2026-11-16","2026-11-16","0000858877-26-000194","2026-11-17",1],["S",6,10912,1032689.22,"2026-11-16","2026-11-16","0000858877-26-000195","2026-11-17",1],["S",6,680,74922.4,"2026-09-14","2026-09-14","0000858877-26-000138","2026-09-14",1],["S",0,312,34376.16,"2026-